.TH hex2bin 1 "2026 November 14" ""

.SH NAME
hex2bin  \- Convert Intel hex file to binary

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hex2bin
<input.hex> <output.bin>

.SH COPYRIGHT
CoreLAB is Copyright (C) 2026 by Pozsar Zsolt.

.SH DESCRIPTION
The hex2bin script converts an Intel hex format file to a binary file. It serves
as a simple wrapper around the objcopy utility.
.PP
The script is useable on Unix-like operating systems.

.SH FILES
.TP
.B *.bin:
Output file where the converted binary data is saved.
.TP
.B *.hex:
Input file containing Intel hex data.

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Normal exit.
.TP
.B 1
Insufficient parameters.
.TP
.B 2
Missing dependency.

.SH HOMEPAGE
.UR https://pozsarzs.github.io/corelab
.UE
